# Netlify equivalent of vercel.json. Prerendered pages are real files and win; the
# client-only routes fall back to the SPA shell (see scripts/prerender.mjs), with and
# without a trailing slash. There is deliberately no catch-all: unknown URLs get
# Netlify's own 404.html. scripts/check-soft-404.mjs keeps this list identical to
# the rewrites in vercel.json.
/blog         /_shell.html     200
/blog/        /_shell.html     200
/heimlog      /_shell.html     200
/heimlog/     /_shell.html     200
/en/blog      /en/_shell.html  200
/en/blog/     /en/_shell.html  200
/en/heimlog   /en/_shell.html  200
/en/heimlog/  /en/_shell.html  200
